           <country>ES</country>    
    </track>
    <track><artist>Manu Chao &amp; Tonino Carotone</artist>
           <title>La Trampa</title>
           <quote>caí en la trampa de ser tu amigo, caí en la trampa de tí confiar</quote>
           <year>2000</year>
           <country>FR</country>    
    </track>
    <track><artist>Gogol Bordello</artist>
           <title>Start Wearing Purple</title>
           <quote>all your sanity and wits they will all vanish, i promise, it's just a matter of time</quote>
           <year>1999</year>
           <country>US</country>    
    </track>
    <track><artist>Russkaja</artist>
           <title>Законы Подлости</title>
           <quote translation = "i like to play loud, at a late and quiet hour">люблю лабать я громко, в ночной и тихий час</quote>
           <year>2006</year>
           <country>AT</country>    
    </track>
    <track><artist>Csókolom</artist>
           <title>Amari Szi, Amari</title>
           <quote translation = "make way, children, let the old man dance">keren, savorále, drom te khelei o phuro rom</quote>
           <year>1998</year>
           <country>HU</country>    
    </track>
    <track><artist>Fanfare Ciocărlia</artist>
           <title>Ah Ya Bibi</title>
           <quote translation = "vladimir ilyich lenin: while the state exists, there can be no freedom. when there is freedom there will be no state.">владимир ильич ульянов: пока есть государство, нет свободы. когда будет свобода, не будет государства.</quote>
